@@ -6,6 +6,18 @@ Format follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/); this repo uses
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### `packages/ui` is gone; `src/shared/ui` is the component layer
+
+`@jtdigital/ui` had no consumer in any of the 58 fluent-html repos and failed the fluent-html lint with 36
+errors. Installed as a dependency, its classes would not reach an app's CSS either: the safelist scans
+`src/**/*.ts` and the extractor skips `node_modules`. Every app already takes its components from
+`src/shared/ui`.
+
+- `packages/ui` is deleted, with its lockfile importer, its row in the workspace fluent-html pin test
+  and its README entry. The design-system PM scope is archived as killed.
+- `selectStyle` joins `inputStyle` and `textareaStyle` in `src/shared/ui/form.ts`: the same field look
+  on a `<select>`. Three apps and three of four agent runs had been writing it by hand.
+
 ### The integration suite passes beside every module, and CI runs it that way
 
 CI ran the integration suite on one combo, `auth + account + files + renderbox*`, so a test that
