+> **Outcome:** killed: components stay in each app's `src/shared/ui`; `packages/ui` deleted ([decision](../../fluent-html-v6/decisions.md), 01. 10. 26).
+
+# design-system (`@jtdigital/ui`) — PRD
+
+## Problem
+
+v6 cut every opinionated visual component to user-land (curation §4 — "instruction set, not a component kit"): semantic blocks (Alert/Badge/Card/…), overlays (Modal/Drawer/Toast), layout (Shell/Nav/LoadingBar), form field stacks (Field/FieldError), icons, the data grid, and the SEO head. The template already has working versions of most; without a shared package, every scaffolded app re-copies them.
+
+## Appetite
+
+Large — a net-new component library built **on v6 primitives**, shared across apps. Roadmap **P6**. Depends on the published core and (for context-reading components) [../fastify-adapter](../fastify-adapter/).
+
+## Solution
+
+Stand up **`@jtdigital/ui`** — components composed on v6 primitives, no opinions the library should own:
+
+- **Semantic** (B-03) — `Alert`/`Callout`/`Badge` (enum→variant via `Match`), `Card`/`CardHeader`/`StatCard`, `Skeleton`; button-variant + typography `.apply()` helpers.
+- **Overlays** (B-02) — `Modal`/`Drawer` composing native `Dialog()` + `behavior("openDialog"/"closeDialog")`; `ToastContainer` (receiver script + `.trigger("showToast")` contract).
+- **Layout** (B-04) — `Container`/`Shell`/`NavItem`/`SidebarNav`/`TabNav`/`LoadingBar` on `Document()` + styling + `.htmxIndicator()`.
+- **Forms** (B-01) — `Field` (label+input+error stack), `FieldError`, `FieldHint` on the library's `Form<T>` binding + `f.error(name)`.
+- **Icons** (B-05) — the `Icon` component + the vendored icon set on the v6 SVG element coverage (no `Raw("<svg…>")` — enforced by `no-raw-icon-string`).
+- **Data grid** (B-06) — `DataTable`/`Pagination`/sortable headers/`tableState` on `Table`/`Th`/`Td` + `defineRoutes`.
+- **SEO head** (A-06) — `SeoHead`/`OgMeta`/`TwitterCard` on `Document()` + typed `Meta().setProperty()`.
+
+## Rabbit Holes
+
+- **Promote, don't rewrite** — the template's existing components are the starting point; repackage into the canonical shape and drop their v5/v3 styling assumptions.
+- **Presets are `.apply()` helpers, not theme** — card/button styles live here as composable helpers, not in `defineTheme`.
+- **Styling stays render-time fluent methods** — so the extractor safelist picks classes up; if a component emits classes invisibly (like `.overlay()`), document the safelist need.
+
+## No-Gos
+
+- No business logic / auth / data fetching — pure presentation composed on primitives.
+- No `Raw(icon)` — icons are typed SVG Views.
+
+## Cross-reference
+
+`fluent-html/product/research/v6/40-synthesis/curation.md` §4 (the cut rows) · the B-01..B-06 / A-06 RFCs under `…/20-design/track-b-new-apis/`. Alignment §2. v6 primitives these build on shipped in `fluent-html@6` (Form<T>, dialog behaviors, SVG coverage, `.htmxIndicator()`, `Document()`).
